WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:02.320
The Wuzhao have been attacking hard for several days

00:02.400 --> 00:03.360
But today

00:03.440 --> 00:04.920
When the volunteers came to help

00:05.000 --> 00:06.960
They didn't launch an ambush or block them

00:07.040 --> 00:08.360
This point

00:08.440 --> 00:09.520
Is especially suspicious

00:09.600 --> 00:11.000
It is suspicious

00:12.240 --> 00:13.520
But
